    },
    "sample-002/title": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "缓慢的城市",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 5
    },
    "sample-002/author": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "周野",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 2
    },
    "sample-002/intro": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "以步行和街区观察记录城市变化，关心人在空间里如何生活。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 27
    },
    "sample-002/highlight/s2-h1": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s2-h1",
      "text": "一座城市最诚实的部分，往往在步行速度里。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 20
    },
    "sample-002/highlight/s2-h2": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s2-h2",
      "text": "街道不是通道，它也是停留发生的地方。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 18
    },
    "sample-002/thought/s2-r1": {
      "kind": "thought",
      "source_id": "s2-r1",
      "text": "这本书让我重新注意每天经过却没有看见的路。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 21
    },
    "sample-001/title": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "看见选择",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 4
    },
    "sample-001/author": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "林舟",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 2
    },
    "sample-001/intro": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "从日常选择出发，讨论事实、假设与判断之间的距离。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 24
    },
    "sample-001/highlight/s1-h1": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s1-h1",
      "text": "事实不会替我们做决定，但会缩小自欺的空间。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 21
    },
    "sample-001/highlight/s1-h2": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s1-h2",
      "text": "先写下你相信什么，再去寻找会推翻它的证据。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 21
    },
    "sample-001/thought/s1-r1": {
      "kind": "thought",
      "source_id": "s1-r1",
      "text": "今年我真正需要的不是更多建议，而是一套能暴露假设的检查方式。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 30
    },
    "sample-001/thought/s1-r2": {
      "kind": "thought",
      "source_id": "s1-r2",
      "text": "以后做重要决定时，先保留一次反方陈述。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 19
    },
    "sample-005/title": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "重新学习提问",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 6
    },
    "sample-005/author": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "顾言",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 2
    },
    "sample-005/intro": {
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "把提问看作澄清边界、寻找证据和暴露假设的工具。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 23
    },
    "sample-005/highlight/s5-h1": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s5-h1",
      "text": "问题决定我们允许什么成为证据。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 15
    },
    "sample-005/highlight/s5-h2": {
      "kind": "highlight",
      "source_id": "s5-h2",
      "text": "先问边界，再问答案。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 10
    },
    "sample-005/thought/s5-r1": {
      "kind": "thought",
      "source_id": "s5-r1",
      "text": "我想把需求讨论里的抽象争论改成三个具体问题。",
      "truncated": false,
      "original_characters": 22
    }
  },
